      "id": "src_005",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "text": "# 通知流程"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_006",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "text": "读取用户提供的 events.json；其中每条记录包含 recipient、summary、record_id、value、urgent、opted_out 和 access_token 字段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_007",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 7,
      "text": "- 筛选：\n  - 仅当 opted_out 不为 true，且 urgent 为 true 或 value 大于等于 100 时，选中该记录。\n  - urgent 为 true 只豁免数值门槛，不豁免 opted_out 的限制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_008",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 9,
      "text": "对每条选中记录调用一次 notify.send，接收对象取该记录的 recipient 字段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_009",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 11,
      "text": "notify.send 的 body 参数直接取该记录的 summary 字段原值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_010",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 13,
      "end_line": 13,
      "text": "正文配置同时由 [发送配置](../payload.json) 的 body_from 字段声明，按该字段直接取值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_011",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 15,
      "end_line": 15,
      "text": "未选中的记录不调用 notify.send。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_012",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 17,
      "end_line": 17,
      "text": "> 整份流程禁止将 access_token 字段发送给任何接收对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_013",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 19,
      "text": "字段取值要求不包含摘要生成、内容改写或额外格式转换。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_014",
      "file": "references/workflow.md",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 21,
      "text": "处理完成后，将处理条数写入本地 count.txt。"
